        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro arcade-style, 2D vertical scrolling shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art inspired by 16-bit consoles and arcade games from the '80s and '90s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on the exhilarating <strong>&quot;aim, shoot, kill&quot;</strong> feel of the original shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive communications from Controller Luna as you progress through each stage's story (6 stages in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes exciting new features like atmospheric re-entry and escorting allied aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a shooter game that deliberately avoids rapid fire and excessive bullet barrages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/06d510c2d20d27c8ff9bb19b009f60a8.avif?t=1765116534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras_big/06d510c2d20d27c8ff9bb19b009f60a8.webp?t=1765116534 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/a3aae5198707eb43566404ad3faee66b.avif?t=1765116534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras_big/a3aae5198707eb43566404ad3faee66b.webp?t=1765116534 width=1560 height=1041 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;STORY&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global nuclear war once contaminated Earth, making it uninhabitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surviving humans migrated to the moon and colonies, slowly redeveloping from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/3117311ff9f98219995c6ad7b174f3c3.avif?t=1765116534\" width=280 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hundred years later, the Quinn AI, the bio-computer that is humanity's brain, rebelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It secretly constructed a barrier that covered the entire Earth, blocking human incursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/f301575b0735ff6b5194ef72dae441cb.avif?t=1765116534\" width=280 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another one hundred years passed, and now that Earth has been blocked by the Earth Barrier and the Quinn AI automatons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the human military launched an operation to destroy the Quinn AI in order to reclaim the Earth for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;How to play&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your ship and destroy enemy ships to progress through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls include a D-pad (stick) and two buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire shots and missiles with the shot key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between attack mode, barrier mode, and charge mode with the Funbit mode switch button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/c993ce1afd12600dc2d887bc85208422.avif?t=1765116534\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Shots and Missiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are standard and power shots. Press and hold the shot button and then release it to fire a power shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the shot button while locked on to fire a homing missile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies have air and ground attributes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lock on to ground enemies with the aim and destroy them with missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat airborne enemies with standard shots, power shots, or missiles fired from your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Fanbit Forms and Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fanbits are autonomous remote-controlled machines that deploy around your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fanbits can switch between attack and barrier forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Remaining energy Since the energy gauge is limited, when it reaches zero, it must be combined with your ship and recharged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon bags are dropped from supply ships, allowing you to select your Funbit's weapon by retrieving them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Laser beam, shotgun, or circular orbital shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About power packs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Power packs are dropped by destroying certain enemy ships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By retrieving them, you can increase speed, extend your aim, extend your Funbit, replenish your shield, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when your ship is hit and its shield level reaches zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(There is no limit to the number of continues, so you can start the stage over again.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro arcade-style, 2D vertical scrolling shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art inspired by 16-bit consoles and arcade games from the '80s and '90s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on the exhilarating <strong>&quot;aim, shoot, kill&quot;</strong> feel of the original shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive communications from Controller Luna as you progress through each stage's story (6 stages in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes exciting new features like atmospheric re-entry and escorting allied aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a shooter game that deliberately avoids rapid fire and excessive bullet barrages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/06d510c2d20d27c8ff9bb19b009f60a8.avif?t=1765116534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras_big/06d510c2d20d27c8ff9bb19b009f60a8.webp?t=1765116534 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras/a3aae5198707eb43566404ad3faee66b.avif?t=1765116534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176470/extras_big/a3aae5198707eb43566404ad3faee66b.webp?t=1765116534 width=1560 height=1041 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;STORY&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global nuclear war once contaminated Earth, making it uninhabitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surviving humans migrated to the moon and colonies, slowly redeveloping from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"